OL,3,GNEWSABattery warning after recycling
OL,4,Aplant fires
OL,5,
OL,6,FA recycling centre which has seen
OL,7,Fseveral fires break out this year is
OL,8,Furging people to dispose of their
OL,9,Felectrical items responsibly.
OL,11,FThere have been five recorded fires at
OL,12,FGAP Group Recycling centre in Gateshead
OL,13,Fduring 2026, which were caused by
OL,14,Flithium ion batteries.
OL,16,FVapes, powerbanks and electric
OL,17,Ftoothbrushes are just some of the
OL,18,Feveryday items which contain the
OL,19,Fflammable batteries.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
