OL,3,GNEWSABattery warning after recycling
OL,4,Aplant fires
OL,5,
OL,6,FManager Chris Gaffney said: "We've had
OL,7,Ffour small fires on site and one in the
OL,8,Fback of a truck which was pretty
OL,9,Flively, we were able to contain them
OL,10,Fsafely and are prepared to do so, but
OL,11,Fthey can be very dangerous."
